{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"57f30725e54ead18d5f2608a368eb370ba35e0412b91bfed258d89205e7720d7","ja":"瑞希が応援している人","zh":"瑞希支持的人","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"63dd4a69ef3f01517a8042618ac71b429d5a3b58d14314986910289d4481a386","ja":"じーっ……………………………………\n……………………………………………………。","zh":"一直盯着……………………………………\n……………………………………………………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"04eaed75474b64bb69f3d530d1b094529538d9791a192e4805969b725dcbea55","ja":"あっ、瑞希ちゃん、お疲れ様～。","zh":"啊，瑞希，辛苦啦～","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[18].text","source_sha256":"685220018ee05258ab56c6ae691a32ad4072ae5dc7e8be100022bb71f5d415cd","ja":"やっほー、ミズキ～！\nスマホとにらめっこして、どうしたノ？　……おーい！","zh":"嗨——瑞希～！\n一直盯着手机看，怎么啦？……喂——！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"0d8c944b8688a9bd37088713eb96f847b34f9778784425342f5044d7fbce4bf4","ja":"……はっ、すみません、皆さんが来ていたのに\n気づいていませんでした。……夢中になっていたぞ。","zh":"……啊，抱歉，大家都来了我却没注意到。……刚才太专心了。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"77042f834d661090543ee7a58d34e1305f4341a08a69be264dff99daf5dffac3","ja":"……今、ネトスワでポーカーの大会を見ていました。","zh":"……刚才在Netoge上看了扑克大赛。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"be9028980540f58561f8c57e378a6eb241e247b11518f9d8518d6ce23df65b43","ja":"あっ、前にミズキが話してた番組？\nみんな真剣な表情してて、かっこいいネ！","zh":"啊，是之前瑞希提到过的节目吗？\n大家都一脸认真，看起来真帅气！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"45a42390dc90b30904356759626b4e0a84008300feee5e6ddd7028320ca8844e","ja":"はい。プレイヤーの皆さんは、\nどんな状況でも表情を変えないのに……。","zh":"是的。各位玩家明明无论处于什么状况，表情都不会改变……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"679e409f6fe8cd273a02fd4879731f23dbd9b9a8acca4207f5755c87745c98d8","ja":"テーブルの上では、手に汗握る展開が\n繰り広げられています。……ドキドキ。","zh":"桌面上正展开着扣人心弦的对局……好紧张。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"fb02392650451bfcd2d738e3ee1c39978e2f3287aa34d12056b90e19522277a9","ja":"私たちが入ってきたことに、気がつかないくらい\n集中してたもんね。そんなに面白いんだ！","zh":"你专注到连我们进来了都没注意到呢。真的有那么有趣吗！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"3770158bc5e557d2a5d47e388117c1bace26ddbfacd806f580dc315b1f170d90","ja":"も、もしかして……応援している人が\n出場しているんですか……？","zh":"难、难道……有支持的人\n正在参赛吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[40].text","source_sha256":"017c840ebca565c4044709f7931901757a975e9f75812905942541c185d708e6","ja":"はい。私が応援しているのは、この人です。","zh":"是的，我支持的是这个人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"9ae0c96d812bee4da5ef9cfca13640037ff7838cb59e1ff71c8f3bc7014e0752","ja":"……あれっ？　この人、カードを配ったりしてて、\nポーカーはしていないよネ？","zh":"……咦？这个人一直在发牌，好像没在玩扑克吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"d7d41b1ff30ae20446bc047baf59c657be898d83697348001c84c8e3f2523f71","ja":"はい。ディーラーと言って、\nポーカーの進行役を務める人です。","zh":"是的。所谓发牌员，\n就是负责主持扑克流程的人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"32cdfe6d4f21c965d9dfcd3c3fc9cf95282cad2f33e369e96a09c5f40c71ccdd","ja":"見てください、\nこの正確にカードを配る手つき……うっとり。","zh":"请看，这精准发牌的手法……真令人陶醉。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[44].text","source_sha256":"0666f4a36c4e94e4438aa68e4bdfcfb22849d782f4dfa8d83ed9fd3338d03830","ja":"へぇ～。言われてみたら、動きがかっこいいかも。","zh":"哦～。你这么一说，动作确实挺帅的。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[45].text","source_sha256":"bb114021f96aa1be456a644ff553616820c92173166f32217d79234f157ea296","ja":"もちろん、プレイヤーを見るのも楽しいですが、\n今回の大会は、この人が気になってしまいました。","zh":"当然，观看玩家也很有意思，不过这次的比赛让我不由得关注起了这个人。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[46].text","source_sha256":"e6aa521d92b623b1a1ee32b76450764ec73998c3d59eb40660d26349077ddf51","ja":"私もクールでかっこいいディーラーに\nなってみたいです。……あこがれるぞ。","zh":"我也想成为又酷又帅气的荷官……真令人向往。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077950","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1813.unity3d","item_key":"commands[47].text","source_sha256":"33d0649a86a85c142348a00a653da4f09fd68ada97d3900d85e70fa9a08be918","ja":"それなら今、叶えちゃおうヨ！\nみんなでポーカーするノ！　ミズキがディーラーで！","zh":"那现在就实现它吧！\n大家一起玩扑克吧！让瑞希来当荷官！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-27T06:10:41+00:00"}
